    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This section provides guidance to assist you in maintaining transparency and impartiality throughout the tender evaluation process.",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The evaluation of tenders must be robust. This is because you must be able to provide a full justification and an audit trail for your resulting award decision.",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Tender evaluation and contract award documentation can be made available under the Freedom of Information (Scotland) Act 2002 , if requested. You must ensure that your procurement process can withstand scrutiny.",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "You must consider planning , sustainable procurement and risk management throughout this stage of the journey.",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    }
